#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:2
msgid "Run and Diagnose Godot Projects"
msgstr "运行并诊断 Godot 项目"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio can use Godot as both a project tool and a source of read-only "
"evidence. This helps you move from “the file looks right” to “the project"
" actually runs.”"
msgstr "Studio 可以将 Godot 同时作为项目工具和只读证据来源。这能帮助你从“文件看起来没问题”走向“项目确实可以运行”。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:9
msgid "Launch and stop"
msgstr "启动和停止"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:11
msgid ""
"From a session summary or an agent request, Studio can launch the Godot "
"editor, run the project, run a selected scene, stop the project, and read"
" debug output when the configured executable and Bridge capabilities "
"allow it."
msgstr "根据会话摘要或 agent 请求，在配置的可执行文件和 Bridge 能力允许时，Studio 可以启动 Godot 编辑器、运行项目、运行选定场景、停止项目并读取调试输出。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:16
msgid "Running a scene"
msgstr "运行场景"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:18
msgid ""
"The session summary can search the project's scene files. Choose a scene "
"and confirm it before running. If no scenes are found, check that the "
"workspace source folder is correct and that the files use the expected "
"``.tscn`` or ``.scn`` extension."
msgstr "会话摘要可以搜索项目的场景文件。运行前请选择并确认场景。如果没有找到场景，请检查工作区源文件夹是否正确，以及文件是否使用预期的 ``.tscn`` 或 ``.scn`` 扩展名。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:23
msgid ""
"Use a scene run to verify one feature quickly. Use a full project run "
"when the feature depends on project settings, autoloads, input actions, "
"or scene transitions."
msgstr "使用场景运行可以快速验证一项功能。当功能依赖项目设置、自动加载、输入操作或场景切换时，请运行完整项目。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:28
msgid "Language server diagnostics"
msgstr "语言服务器诊断"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:30
msgid ""
"Godot LSP tools can report server status, file diagnostics, document "
"symbols, symbol hover information, and definitions. They are useful for "
"questions such as:"
msgstr "Godot LSP 工具可以报告服务器状态、文件诊断、文档符号、符号悬停信息和定义。它们适合回答以下问题："

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:34
msgid "“Why is this class name unresolved?”"
msgstr "“为什么找不到这个类名？”"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:35
msgid "“Where is this signal or method defined?”"
msgstr "“这个信号或方法在哪里定义？”"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:36
msgid "“Which warning is attached to this line?”"
msgstr "“这一行关联了哪条警告？”"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:38
msgid ""
"LSP results are read-only. They help the agent understand the code but do"
" not change the project."
msgstr "LSP 结果是只读的。它们帮助 agent 理解代码，但不会修改项目。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:42
msgid "Debugger data"
msgstr "调试器数据"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:44
msgid ""
"The first Daedalus DAP integration is intentionally read-only. It can "
"report debugger status, the last debugger error, a stack trace, and "
"debugger variables. It does not launch or control execution, set "
"breakpoints, evaluate arbitrary expressions, or call runtime methods."
msgstr "第一版 Daedalus DAP 集成有意保持只读。它可以报告调试器状态、最近的调试器错误、堆栈跟踪和调试器变量，但不会启动或控制执行、设置断点、计算任意表达式或调用运行时方法。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:50
msgid "Logs and editor state"
msgstr "日志和编辑器状态"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:52
msgid ""
"Godot tools can inspect project log configuration, list and read project "
"logs, read editor settings summaries, browse editor configuration files, "
"inspect editor project state, and list recent projects. Logs can contain "
"local paths, user names, errors, or game data; review them before "
"attaching them to a conversation or issue."
msgstr "Godot 工具可以检查项目日志配置、列出并读取项目日志、读取编辑器设置摘要、浏览编辑器配置文件、检查编辑器项目状态以及列出最近项目。日志可能包含本机路径、用户名、错误或游戏数据；附加到对话或 issue 前请先审查。"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:59
msgid "An evidence-first debugging request"
msgstr "以证据为先的调试请求"

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:61
msgid "Try a request like::"
msgstr "可以尝试这样的请求："

#: ../../source/godot/diagnostics.rst:67
msgid ""
"This keeps diagnosis separate from repair. After you understand the "
"cause, start a Plan or Agent request for the smallest fix and run the "
"same check again."
msgstr "这样可以将诊断与修复分开。了解原因后，启动 Plan 或 Agent 请求来完成最小修复，并再次运行相同的检查。"
